# A bare consonant before the anusvara keeps its vowel (अलंबार ɔlɔŋbar,
# गसंना ɡɔsɔŋna): the anusvara closes that syllable.
ं -> ॉङ् / {C} _
# य and व after a vowel (or a bare consonant) before a consonant or the end
# of the word: the second half of a diphthong.
य -> इ / {VL} _ {C} | {VL} _ # | {C} _ {C} | {C} _ #
व -> उ / {VL} _ {C} | {VL} _ #

